    comfort: "An Aquarius Moon often finds comfort in community and in its own eccentric interests. Joining a club, volunteering, tinkering with technology, stargazing or getting lost in a niche hobby can restore it. Home tends to be unconventional, reflecting its personality rather than expectations, and may serve as a hub for friends. Time alone to think is equally important. Conversations about ideas and the future can lift its spirits, and a bold rearrangement of furniture or routine can feel wonderfully refreshing.",
